  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1401</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>お、重いよぉ……
繊細な芸術家に
こんな重労働させるなんてぇ〜</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh, so heavy... I can’t believe you're
making a poor little artist carry all this junk!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>official: Flying the Coop; Gamefaqs: Escape!</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6444</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1402</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……逃げるぞ、&lt;Beryl&gt;。
思念術で隙をつくれ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Let's make a break for it &lt;Beryl&gt;.
Use one of your Will artes to distract her,
and then we'll―</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6872</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1403</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はぁ〜い、なんの相談かしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my, what seems to be
the issue over here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;C1403b&gt;あ、そうそう！
契約書には、無断で逃げた社員は
『グチャッ』と捕らえて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you needed a reminder of my policy!
All employees who attempt an escape
will be met with a "splat."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7596</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1404</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『グチャッ』と……!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-Whaddaya mean, “splat?!"</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7852</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1405</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『ゴキッ』としめる——と
あるのを忘れないでね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Followed by a "snap,"
so don't forget now!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7976</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1406</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『ゴキッ』と……!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A "snap?!"</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8172</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1407</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あきらめよう、&lt;Hisui&gt;……
命あってのモノマネだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're toast, &lt;Hisui&gt;...
Resistance is few dialed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8296</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1408</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……『モノダネ』だろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Don’t you mean “futile?”</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
